Chameleons don't turn into player-monsters (such as the rogue and
samurai that the OP mentioned); what we're dealing with here is a
doppelganger, the next shapeshifter up. Doppelgangers have a 1/7
chance to turn into something from the 'nasties' list, so while
chameleons _can_ become something highly dangerous, doppelgangers
almost certainly _will_ soon enough.

(Sandestins, an even higher-level shapeshifter, will become nasties
6/7 of the time.)

